==History==

2025

* Card was added in the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (1/12/2025)|2025 Quarter 4 Update]] with the other 3 original heroes [[Knight/Hero|Knight]], [[Musketeer/Hero|Musketeer]], and [[Giant/Hero|Giant]]{{Balance|Add}}.
* On 22/12/2025 a [[Version History#Maintenance Break (22/12/2025)|Maintenance Break]], allowed Hero Mini P.E.K.K.A to be a summonable hero. Previously he could only be gotten in [[Pass Royale]]{{Balance|Add}}.
2026
* On 12/1/2026, a  [[Version History#Balance Changes (12/1/2026)|Balance Update]], decreased the Hero Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s healing to 30% (from 40%){{Balance|Nerf}}, and decreased the it's Hitpoints by 3%{{Balance|Nerf}}.
* On 2/2/2026, a [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (2/2/2026)|Balance Update]], increased the Hero Mini P.E.K.K.A.'s cook time to 22 seconds (from 20 seconds){{Balance|Nerf}}.

